@c ====================================================================
@node OpenType tables
@chapter OpenType tables

The @code{runes/otf} system, package @code{RUNES/OTF}, nickname
@code{OTF}, is the low-level layer under @code{zpb-ttf}.  A font is
held in memory once and its tables are read straight from the bytes
without copying.  Every read is bounds-checked.

@menu
* Font data::                   Windows into the font's bytes.
* Table readers::               The generated accessors.
* Web fonts::                   WOFF and WOFF2.
* OpenType conditions::         Errors.
@end menu

