@c ====================================================================
@node CFF charstrings
@chapter CFF charstrings

The @code{runes/otf/charstring} system, package
@code{RUNES/OTF/CHARSTRING}, evaluates the Type 2 charstrings of
@samp{CFF } and @samp{CFF2} tables, a port of Fontations'
interpreter, with its DICT parser and font structures.  @code{zpb-ttf}
uses it for CFF outlines; use it directly to receive the outline
commands yourself.

The @code{seac} operator, used by some old Adobe fonts for accented
glyphs, is not supported and signals an error.

